OL,3,GNEWSA'Miracle' cars not fallen off
OL,4,Abridge - councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has said it is an
OL,7,F"absolute miracle" cars have not fallen
OL,8,Foff a bridge and into the river after
OL,9,Fit was struck three times in the space
OL,10,Fof six weeks.
OL,12,FThomas de Freitas is urging highways
OL,13,Fbosses to extend the safety barrier on
OL,14,FBank Bridge on the A59 in Tarleton,
OL,15,Fwhich forms part of a main route
OL,16,Fbetween Preston and Southport.
OL,18,FConcrete blocks were used to plug a gap
OL,19,Fat the side of the bridge after the
OL,20,Fmost serious of the incidents in July,
OL,21,Fbut within a month the blocks were
OL,22,Fstruck.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
