OL,3,GNEWSA'Miracle' cars not fallen off
OL,4,Abridge - councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe West Lancashire North county
OL,7,Fcouncillor said "potentially, it's just
OL,8,Fa matter of time" before a vehicle
OL,9,Ffalls into the River Douglas, which the
OL,10,Fcrossing spans.
